choice   scaled-top-only = 2 shaded parts in every 6 equal parts [1/3]
choice   scaled-bottom-only = 1 shaded part in every 12 equal parts [1/12]
step 1   Group every 2 small parts into one larger part.   [2/12 = 1/6]"
`;

